<view class="page"><view class="eyebrow">PERSONAL HEALTH FILE</view><view class="title">本人就诊档案</view><view class="subtitle">查看本人登记资料、过敏情况和就诊信息。</view><view wx:if="{{busy}}" class="loading">正在读取本人档案…</view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view><view wx:if="{{!patient && !busy}}" class="empty"><view class="empty-symbol">＋</view><view class="empty-title">本人档案尚未展示</view><view class="description">微信登录后，首次填写本人资料即可预约；已有档案可申请安全关联。</view><button type="primary" bindtap="binding">填写本人就诊资料</button><button class="link" bindtap="login">前往微信登录</button></view><block wx:if="{{patient}}"><view class="card"><view class="row"><view class="card-title">{{patient.full_name}}</view><text class="badge">本人档案</text></view><view class="description">患者编号 {{patient.patient_number}}</view><view class="divider"></view><view class="detail-row"><text class="detail-label">出生日期</text><text class="detail-value">{{patient.date_of_birth}}</text></view><view class="detail-row"><text class="detail-label">联系电话</text><text class="detail-value">{{patient.phone}}</text></view><view class="detail-row"><text class="detail-label">账单地址</text><text class="detail-value">{{patient.billing_address}}</text></view><view class="detail-row"><text class="detail-label">电子邮箱</text><text class="detail-value">{{patient.email || '未提供'}}</text></view><view class="detail-row"><text class="detail-label">紧急联系人</text><text class="detail-value">{{patient.emergency_contact_name}}</text></view><view class="detail-row"><text class="detail-label">紧急联系电话</text><text class="detail-value">{{patient.emergency_contact_phone}}</text></view></view><view class="card"><view class="card-title">过敏情况</view><view wx:if="{{patient.self_reported_allergies}}" class="notice">{{patient.self_reported_allergies}}<view class="hint">本人声明，尚不代表医护复核结果。</view></view><view class="notice">{{statusText}}</view><view wx:for="{{allergies}}" wx:key="allergy_id" class="allergy-row"><view class="row"><text>{{item.allergy_name}}</text><text class="badge {{item.is_retracted ? 'gray' : 'warn'}}">{{item.is_retracted ? '已撤销误记' : '当前记录'}}</text></view><view wx:if="{{item.severity_note}}" class="description">程度：{{item.severity_note}}</view><view wx:if="{{item.clinical_note}}" class="description">备注：{{item.clinical_note}}</view></view><view wx:if="{{!allergies.length}}" class="description">暂无关联记录。是否已确认无过敏，以核实状态为准。</view><button wx:if="{{next}}" class="link" bindtap="more" disabled="{{busy}}">加载更多记录</button></view><button class="secondary" bindtap="records">查看本人预约与就诊状态</button></block><view class="spacer"></view><button class="secondary" bindtap="refresh" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}">刷新本人资料</button><view class="footnote">资料及过敏如有变化，请联系前台核验更正。此处展示本人资料与预约状态，不提供未经接口授权的完整病历。</view></view>
